Package: tempoPlot
Title: Microbiome Time Series Visualization
Version: 0.99.13
Authors@R: 
    person("0xMuluh", , , "rysdaena8@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Plots longitudinal microbiome data stored in
    (Tree)SummarizedExperiment and MultiAssayExperiment objects: sampling
    timelines, trajectories of subjects and features, ordination paths and
    community composition over time. Plots use results computed with
    miaTime and mia and are returned as ggplot2 objects.
